{"suttaId":"sn1.43","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-i","vriCode":"s0301m.mul","paras":[555,561],"vripara":"43"},"segments":{"sn1.43:0.3":"Annasuttaṃ","sn1.43:1.1":"“Annamevābhinandanti, ubhaye devamānusā;","sn1.43:1.3":"Atha ko nāma so yakkho, yaṃ annaṃ nābhinandatī”ti.","sn1.43:2.1":"“Ye naṃ dadanti saddhāya, vippasannena cetasā;","sn1.43:2.3":"Tameva annaṃ bhajati, asmiṃ loke paramhi ca.","sn1.43:3.1":"“Tasmā vineyya maccheraṃ, dajjā dānaṃ malābhibhū;","sn1.43:3.3":"Puññāni paralokasmiṃ, patiṭṭhā honti pāṇinan”ti."},"attha":{"book":"Spk-i","bookName":"Sagāthāvagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0301a.att","from":403,"to":403,"paras":[{"para":403,"vripara":"43","refs":["sn1.43:2","sn1.43:3"],"lines":["Tatiye <b>abhinandantī</b>ti patthenti.","<b>Bhajatī</b>ti upagacchati, cittagahapatisīvalittherādike viya pacchato anubandhati.","<b>Tasmā</b>ti yasmā idhaloke paraloke ca annadāyakameva anugacchati, tasmā.","Sesaṃ uttānamevāti.","Tatiyaṃ."],"lineRefs":[["sn1.43:2"],["sn1.43:2"],["sn1.43:3"],["sn1.43:3"],["sn1.43:3"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn1.43:2.3","bhajatī",0,1],["sn1.43:3.1","tasmā",0,2]]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-i","bookName":"Sagāthāvagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0301t.tik","from":488,"to":488,"paras":[{"para":488,"vripara":"43","refs":["sn1.43:1","sn1.43:2","sn1.43:3"],"lines":["<b>Patthentī</b>ti pihenti.","Yatthassa upagamanaṃ loke pākaṭataraṃ ahosi, te udāharaṇavasena dassento <b>“cittagahapatisīvalittherādike viyā”</b>ti āha.","<b>Annan</b>ti annasaññito catubbidhopi paccayo.","Sabbepi dāyake ekajjhaṃ gahetvā sāmaññato ekavasena <b>“dāyakamevā”</b>ti vuttaṃ, yathā cāha <b>“ko nāma so yakkho, yaṃ annaṃ nābhinandatī”</b>ti?","Tattha <b>yakkho</b>ti satto.","Sāmaññajotanā ca nāma yasmā puthuatthavisayā, tasmā <b>“ye naṃ dadanti saddhāya, vippasannena cetasā.</b>","<b>Tameva annaṃ bhajatī”</b>ti vuttaṃ.","Tattha <b>ma</b> -kāro padasandhikaro, te evāti attho.","<b>Dāyakaṃ</b> apariccajanameva <b>anugacchati</b> cakkaṃ viya kubbaraṃ."],"lineRefs":[["sn1.43:1"],["sn1.43:1"],["sn1.43:1"],["sn1.43:1"],["sn1.43:1"],["sn1.43:2"],["sn1.43:2"],["sn1.43:3"],["sn1.43:3"]]}],"wordLinks":[["sn1.43:1.1","annaṃ",0,2],["sn1.43:1.3","annaṃ",0,2],["sn1.43:1.3","ko nāma so yakkho yaṃ annaṃ nābhinandatī",0,3],["sn1.43:1.3","yakkho",0,4],["sn1.43:2.1","ye naṃ dadanti saddhāya vippasannena cetasā",0,5],["sn1.43:2.3","tameva annaṃ bhajatī",0,6],["sn1.43:3.1","ma",0,7]]},"tika2":null}
